ulti-&#10;objective optimization', 'score': 8}, {'text':&#10;'probabilistic programming', 'score': 7}]&#10;source_type: idea_text&#10;top_k: 2&#10;retrieval_mode: semantic&#10;&#10;Returned Papers&#10;1. Agent-Based Modelling as a Tool to Advance Evolutionary&#10;Population Theory (2016) [score=1.0]&#10;Abstract: N/A&#10;&#10;2. A demogenetic individual based model for the evolution&#10;of traits and genome architecture under sexual selection&#10;(2020) [score=0.9846]&#10;Abstract: Abstract Sexual selection has long been known to&#10;favor the evolution of mating behaviors such as mate&#10;preference and competitiveness, and to affect their&#10;genetic architecture, for instance by favoring genetic&#10;correlation between some traits. Reciprocally, genetic&#10;architecture..." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2400" y="49196" width="442" height="708" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge_event_23" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=0;jettySize=0;html=0;dashed=1;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="step_step6" target="retrieval_23"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>